    "书伴默认用设备自带的模型，不联网。你填了自己的 Key 时，提问和书里相关的几段原文会直接发给你选的服务商，费用和隐私条款按你和它的约定；Key 只存在这台设备的钥匙串里。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The companion uses the model on your device by default, offline. With your own key, your question and a few related passages go straight to the provider you chose, under your agreement with them; the key stays in this device's keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "书伴默认用这台 Mac 自带的，不花钱，不联网也能用。想换更强的，就添加一个服务商，填你自己的 Key，费用直接走你的账号，语阅不经手。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Companion uses this Mac's own model by default: free, and it works offline. For a stronger one, add a provider with your own key; charges go straight to your account, and Yuyue never handles them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
