    "我冒了严寒，回到相隔二千余里，别了二十余年的故乡去。时候既然是深冬；渐近故乡时，天气又阴晦了，冷风吹进船舱中，呜呜的响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Braving the bitter cold, I travelled more than seven hundred miles back to the old home I had left over twenty years before. It was the dead of winter, and as I drew near, the weather turned bleak and overcast; a cold wind whistled through the boat's cabin."
          }
        }
      }
